return ['domain'=>'zinn-migrate','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'yo','project-id-version'=>'zinn-migrate','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-01T20:49:02+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-01T20:49:02+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Migrate'=>'Zinn® Migrate','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-migrate'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-migrate','Packages this WordPress site — files and database — into one archive that Zinn Digital® can pull in, for hosts we cannot reach any other way. Install it on the site you are LEAVING, press one button, and paste the link into your Zinn® migration.'=>'Ó ń kó gbogbo ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù WordPress yìí — àwọn fáìlì àti ibi-ìpamọ́ data — sínú àpò-ìpamọ́ kan tí Zinn Digital® le fà wọlé, fún àwọn ẹ̀rọ-ìgbàlejò tí a kò le rí ọ̀nà míràn láti dé ọ̀dọ̀ wọn. Fi sí orí ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù tí o ń FI SÍLẸ̀, tẹ bọ́tìnì kan, kí o sì lẹ ìsopọ̀ náà sínú ìkórelọ Zinn® rẹ.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Move this site to Zinn®'=>'Gbe aaye yii lọ si Zinn®','Move to Zinn®'=>'Gbe lọ si Zinn®','You do not have permission to do this.'=>'O ko ni aṣẹ lati ṣe eyi.','This packages everything on this site — its files and its database — into one archive, and gives you a private link to it. Paste that link into your migration on Zinn® and we will pull the site across. Nothing here is sent anywhere until you choose to share the link.'=>'Èyí ń kó ohun gbogbo lórí ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí — àwọn fáìlì rẹ̀ àti ibi-ìpamọ́ dátà rẹ̀ — sínú àkójọ kan ṣoṣo, ó sì ń fún ọ ní àjápọ̀ àdáni sí i. Lẹ mọ́ àjápọ̀ yẹn sínú ìṣílọ rẹ lórí Zinn® a ó sì gbé ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù náà wá. Kò sí ohun kankan níbí tí a ń fi ránṣẹ́ sí ibikíbi títí tí o fi yàn láti pín àjápọ̀ náà.','You may not need this. If your old host gives you FTP, SSH, cPanel, Plesk or DirectAdmin, Zinn® can fetch the site directly with those details and you can skip this plugin entirely — it is faster and there is nothing left behind afterwards. Use this when none of those are available to you.'=>'O le ma nilo eyi. Ti olupese alejo gbigba atijọ rẹ ba fun ọ ni FTP, SSH, cPanel, Plesk tabi DirectAdmin, Zinn® le gba aaye ayelujara naa taara pẹlu awọn alaye yẹn ati pe o le fo afikun yii patapata — o yara ju bẹẹ si ni ko si ohun ti o fi silẹ lẹhin naa. Lo eyi nigbati ko si ọkan ninu awọn wọnyẹn ti o wa fun ọ.','Room on this server'=>'Ààyè lórí olupin yìí','This server will not tell us how much disk space is free, so we cannot check for you. The package needs roughly %s. If you are not sure there is that much room, ask your host before you build it — a server that runs out of space mid-way takes the site down.'=>'Olupin yii kii yoo sọ iye aaye disk ti o wa ni ofifo fun wa, nitorina a ko le ṣayẹwo rẹ fun ọ. Apo naa nilo nkan bii %s. Ti o ko ba ni idaniloju pe aaye to bẹ wa, beere lọwọ olupese iṣẹ alejo gbigba rẹ ki o to kọ ọ — olupin ti aaye rẹ ba tan ni aarin ọna yoo fa ki aaye ayelujara naa wó lulẹ.','The package needs roughly %1$s and this server has %2$s free.'=>'Àpò náà nílò nǹkan bí %1$s bẹ́ẹ̀ sì ni olupin yìí ní %2$s tí ó ṣófo.','Build the package'=>'Kọ́ àkójọpọ̀ náà','Building…'=>'N kọ ọ…','Now packaging: %1$s. %2$s files so far, %3$s written.'=>'Ní báyìí ń ṣàkójọ: %1$s. Àwọn fáìlì %2$s títí di báyìí, %3$s ti kọ.','your files'=>'Àwọn fáìlì rẹ','your database'=>'Ibùdó dátà rẹ','Continue'=>'Tẹsiwaju','Cancel and delete'=>'Fagilee ki o si paarẹ','Your package is ready'=>'Pákéèjì rẹ ti ṣetán','Copy this link and paste it into your migration on Zinn®:'=>'Ṣe adakọ ọna asopọ yii ki o si lẹ mọ si iṣilọ rẹ lori Zinn®:','Size: %s.'=>'Ìwọ̀n: %s.','Treat this link like a password. Anyone who has it can download your whole site, including your database. We delete the package automatically 24 hours after it was built — delete it yourself as soon as your migration has finished.'=>'Ṣe itọju ọna asopọ yii bi ọrọ igbaniwọle. Ẹnikẹni ti o ba ni le ṣe igbasilẹ gbogbo aaye rẹ, pẹlu ibi ipamọ data rẹ. A n pa akojọpọ naa rẹ laifọwọyi ni wakati 24 lẹhin ti a kọ ọ — pa a rẹ funrararẹ ni kete ti ijira rẹ ba pari.','Delete the package now'=>'Pa àpò náà rẹ́ báyìí','Build it again'=>'Kọ́ ọ lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi','This server does not have PHP’s ZipArchive extension, so we cannot build a package here. Ask your host to enable it, or use the migration form on Zinn® with your FTP or SSH details instead.'=>'Olùpèsè yìí kò ní àfikún ZipArchive ti PHP, nítorí náà a kò lè kọ́ àkójọpọ̀ síhìn-ín. Ẹ bẹ olùpèsè àlejò yín láti mú un ṣiṣẹ́, tàbí dípò bẹ́ẹ̀ ẹ lo fọ́ọ̀mù ìṣípòpadà lórí Zinn® pẹ̀lú àwọn ẹ̀kúnrẹ́rẹ́ FTP tàbí SSH yín.','We could not create a folder inside your uploads directory, so there is nowhere to write the package. Check that wp-content/uploads is writable.'=>'A kò le ṣẹ̀dá àpò-ìfipamọ́ kan sínú àkójọ uploads yín, nítorí náà kò sí ibìkankan láti kọ àkójọpọ̀ náà sí. Ṣàyẹ̀wò pé wp-content/uploads ṣe é kọ sí.','There is no package being built. Start one first.'=>'Kò sí àkójọpọ̀ kankan tí a ń kọ́ lọ́wọ́. Bẹ̀rẹ̀ ọ̀kan kọ́kọ́.','We could not open the package file for writing.'=>'A kò le ṣí fáìlì àpò náà fún kíkọ.','We could not write the database export.'=>'A ko le kọ ìgbéjade ibùdó dátà náà.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — àwọn ìtọ́sọ́nà àti iṣẹ́','User guides'=>'Àwọn ìtọ́sọ́nà olùlò','Read the %s user guide'=>'Ka itọsọna olumulo %s','Hide this'=>'Fi èyí pa mọ́','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Alejo gbigba Zinn® fun WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, àwọn àfipamọ́ ojoojúmọ́, ìṣíwájú ọ̀fẹ́ àti pánẹ́ẹ̀lì ìṣàkóso tí a kọ́ fún àwọn ènìyàn tí ń ṣiṣẹ́ lórí ojúlé web tó ju ẹyọ kan lọ.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Ọjà Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Ra ki o si ta awọn aaye ti a ti fi idi rẹ mulẹ, awọn orukọ agbegbe ati gbigbe ọna asopọ, pẹlu owo ti a tọju lailewu titi ti awọn ẹgbẹ mejeeji yoo fi ni itẹlọrun.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — gbawẹ́ àwọn ènìyàn tí iṣẹ́ yìí jẹ́ ohun ìgbésí ayé wọn','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Ọjà iṣẹ́-àdáni àgbáyé wa: wá nínú àwọn iṣẹ́ tí a ti pèsè sílẹ̀ tí ó ju 10,000 lọ láti ọwọ́ àwọn oǹkọ̀wé, àwọn olùṣe-àpẹẹrẹ, àwọn olùgbéejáde àti àwọn akọ́ṣẹ́mọṣẹ́ SEO, tàbí fi iṣẹ́ sílẹ̀ kí o jẹ́ kí wọ́n dúnadúrà lórí rẹ̀.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Wo àwọn àkọsílẹ̀ ìtúsílẹ̀ Zinn Digital®.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Iṣẹ́ ìfidélọ́ṣọ̀ọ́ Zinn® kò pèsè àjápọ̀ ìgbasílẹ̀ fún ìfidélọ́ṣọ̀ọ́ yìí. Ṣàyẹ̀wò bóyá ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí lè ráàyè sí pẹpẹ Zinn®, lẹ́yìn náà gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Kò le ṣe igbasilẹ imudojuiwọn naa lati iṣẹ imudojuiwọn Zinn® (%s). Gbiyanju lẹẹkansi ni iṣẹju diẹ.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Ìmúdójúìwọ̀n tí a gbàsílẹ̀ kùnà ìdánwò ìpéye rẹ̀, a kò sì fi sípò.']];